=== OVMX 2-node cluster GENESIS rig (rd vms-f6b) ===
mode=rejoin
accel=kvm -cpu host group=2026 recnx=45s stagger=55s
rejoin phase: ON (B_WINDOW1=45s evac_dwell=25s B_WINDOW2=60s)
node A: OVMXA/1025 VOTES=1 EXPECTED_VOTES=1 VAXCLUSTER=2
node B: OVMXB/1026 VOTES=0          VAXCLUSTER=2

--- powering on node A (it must hear nobody for 45s, then found) ---
--- starting the segment relay (reconnect-tolerant: node B may evacuate and rejoin) ---
--- powering on node B, round 1 (first join) ---
--- waiting up to 40s for node B to reach MEMBER ---
    node B reached MEMBER at ~t=8s of its own boot; settling 3s
--- EVACUATING node B (kill -9; node A holds its CSB and keeps dialing for 25s) ---
--- powering on node B, round 2 (REJOIN, same SYSGEN identity) ---

